cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata provided in this file."

title: "cFS Real-Time Aerial Mapping"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Coşgun"
    given-names: "Ahmet"

abstract: >-
  An open-source cFS-based framework for real-time photogrammetric
  mapping from simulated UAV imagery, generating georeferenced dense
  point clouds, digital surface models, and incremental orthomosaics.

keywords:
  - cFS
  - aerial mapping
  - photogrammetry
  - multi-view stereo
  - dense reconstruction
  - digital surface model
  - orthomosaic
  - georeferencing
  - UAV simulation
  - real-time mapping

license: Apache-2.0
